WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.716
A few numbers anchor the demonstration.

00:00:02.796 --> 00:00:07.160
Eleven hours of real LIGO-Hanford noise train the
score model.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:13.181
One thousand twenty-four synthetic realizations
validate the learned power spectrum.

00:00:13.261 --> 00:00:17.912
Inference recovers five source parameters: chirp
mass, mass ratio,

00:00:17.992 --> 00:00:21.424
luminosity distance, coalescence time, and phase.

00:00:21.504 --> 00:00:26.800
Data are sampled at four thousand ninety-six hertz
in four-second segments.
